cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Aya medical safety: find the harm, cut it out, keep it out"
abstract: >-
  Harmful LoRA add-ons for Tiny Aya Global share a few output directions. Removing them cures unseen add-ons without
  data and keeps useful skills, and the cure survives compression. A vaccine delays later harmful fine-tuning, and
  switching off the attack add-on's own strongest arrows undoes it in our tests.
